  "name": "USGS CMG H-1-69-BS-cruise",
  "description": "Beach and offshore sediment sampling, assays of the samples for platinum and gold, and high-resolution seismic profiling for delineating subbottom features. Sampling used a one mile grid.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Investigate economic platinum placers offshore from Goodnews Bay.",
